<title>PORTUGAL: PORTUGAL'S BANCO MELLO H1 NET UP 801 PCT.</title>
<headline>PORTUGAL'S BANCO MELLO H1 NET UP 801 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to June 30:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net 1.379 vs 0.153</p>
<p>Operating result 3.526 vs 1.887</p>
<p>Cash flow 9.392 vs 5.686</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Banco Mello SA. &quot;The good results achieved at the end of the first semester confirm the sustained growth in the profitability of the bank via an increase in various areas of its business and an appreciable improvement in its operational efficiency,&quot; Francisco de Lacerda, president of the bank, said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
